N        EQU   16
M        EQU   10
INPUT    EQU   1000
PILES    EQU   1050
OUT      EQU   1100
LINK     EQU   4:5
TOP      EQU   1:2
         ORIG  3000
START    ENT1  N           R1. Loop on k. P ← LOC(RN).
         ENT3  2           k ← 1.
2H       ENT2  M-1         R2. Set piles empty.
         ENTA  PILES-INPUT,2  LOC(BOTM[i])
         STA   PILES,2(TOP)  → TOP[i].
         STZ   PILES,2(LINK)  BOTM[i] ← Λ.
         DEC2  1
         J2NN  *-4         M > i ≥ 0.
         LDA   R3SW,3
         STA   3F          Modify instructions for pass k.
         LDA   R5SW,3
         STA   5F
3H       LD2   INPUT,1(3:3)  R3. Extract kth digit of key.
4H       LD4   PILES,2(TOP)  R4. Adjust links.
         ST1   INPUT,4(LINK)  LINK(TOP[i]) ← P.
         ST1   PILES,2(TOP)  TOP[i] ← P.
5H       DEC1  1           R5. Step to next record.
         J1NZ  3B          To R3 if not end of pass.
6H       ENN2  M           R6. Do Algorithm H.
         JMP   7F          To H2 with i ← 0.
R3SW     LD2   INPUT,1(1:1)  Instruction for R3 when k = 3.
         LD2   INPUT,1(2:2)  Instruction for R3 when k = 2.
         LD2   INPUT,1(3:3)  Instruction for R3 when k = 1.
R5SW     LD1   INPUT,1(LINK)  Instruction for R5 when k = 3.
         LD1   INPUT,1(LINK)  Instruction for R5 when k = 2.
         DEC1  1           Instruction for R5 when k = 1.
9H       LDA   PILES+M,2(LINK)  H4. Is pile empty?
         JAZ   8F          To H3 if BOTM[i] = Λ.
         STA   INPUT,1(LINK)  H5. Tie piles together.
7H       LD1   PILES+M,2(TOP)  H2. Point to top of pile.
8H       INC2  1           H3. Next pile. i ← i + 1.
         J2NZ  9B          To H4 if i ≠ M.
         STZ   INPUT,1(LINK)  LINK(P) ← Λ.
         LD1   PILES(LINK)  P ← BOTM[0].
         DEC3  1
         J3NN  2B          Loop for 1 ≤ k ≤ 3.
         ENT2  0
WALK     LDA   INPUT,1(1:3)
         STA   OUT,2
         INC2  1
         LD1   INPUT,1(LINK)
         J1P   WALK
         HLT
         END   START
